  "raw_text": "A sequencing limitation was identified: gzip only runs after `script` exits cleanly, so abnormal termination of the Claude Code session \u2014 for instance, a crash or forced kill \u2014 would leave an uncompressed raw file and gzip would never execute. This was noted as a known limitation rather than a blocker, since the raw file would still be present and recoverable, but the expected compressed artifact would be absent.",
